  "title": "Pick the exposures first, then the option structure",
  "summary": "Retail traders often start with a structure: today I sell a put or an iron condor. The speaker reverses it. First decide the exposures: bullish or bearish, time frame, conviction. Then pick the structure. Put-call parity gives many ways to get the same view; if you are bullish and volatility is high, a call spread or a short put spread may fit.",
